WEBVTT

NOTE
Accessibility audio description for Final Fantasy VIII - Disc 2 (Game Disc 3)
Scene: disc02_11h.avi - Ragnarok descends toward planet
Duration: approximately 22 seconds
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00.000 --> 00:11.000
The Ragnarok pierces through the thick cloud cover of the planet's atmosphere. The sleek red spacecraft with its distinctive dragon-like wings is silhouetted dramatically against the bright sky. Clouds swirl and scatter around the ship as it descends with purpose and control. The viewport from inside the ship shows the landscape below gradually becoming visible through breaks in the cloud layer.

00:11.000 --> 00:22.000
The clouds thin and part, revealing the landscape beneath. The continent of Esthar comes into view, or perhaps the vast oceans surrounding the landmass. Mountains and terrain features become distinct. The Ragnarok's approach is smooth and graceful, the spacecraft banking gently as it slows its descent and orients itself for final approach to a landing zone. The red hull catches the light of the planet's sun, creating a brilliant contrast against the sky and clouds below. The ship glides smoothly downward, an Esthar marvel of engineering returning to the world it once served. The journey through space is ending. The return to the surface is beginning.
